It's not a  bad idea to just sell off all weapons and armor you aren't
using, or, you can just shove it all in a chest somewhere. monster
tend not to loot containers.

there's a guaranteed altar in the dungeon.  try looking for a second
staircase down on some of the earlier levels.

> b - I'm carrying everything that seems remotely useful and light; a
